# {{PROJECT}} spec

## Problem

{{PROJECT}} has no written behaviour contract yet: scope, acceptance and
non-goals live in chat history, so each change is judged differently.

## Acceptance

- [ ] `galadon check` passes on a fresh clone with the checks declared in `galadon.yaml`
- [ ] `bin/{{NPM_NAME}} ping --json` returns a JSON payload with `"ok": true`
- [ ] `skills/{{NPM_NAME}}/SKILL.md` states when an agent should use the plugin
- [ ] `docs/packaging.md` lists the steps to publish a first version

## Non-goals

- Choosing the first product feature (replace this spec with that feature)
- Publishing to a marketplace from this repository
- Placeholder distribution manifests or icons
